        "description": "Rules determining when the game ends and who wins.",
        "icon": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"76\" height=\"76\" viewBox=\"0 0 76 76\"><g fill=\"none\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"><path fill=\"#EBE3D7\" d=\"M38,0 C27.9201752,0 18.2578742,4.00316874 11.1281465,11.1281465 C4.00316874,18.2577554 0,27.9205315 0,38 C0,48.0794685 4.00316874,57.7421258 11.1281465,64.8718535 C18.2577554,71.9968313 27.9205315,76 38,76 C48.0794685,76 57.7421258,71.9968313 64.8718535,64.8718535 C71.9968313,57.7422446 76,48.0794685 76,38 C76,27.9205315 71.9968313,18.2578742 64.8718535,11.1281465 C57.7422446,4.00316874 48.0794685,0 38,0 Z\"/><path fill=\"#2B2117\" d=\"M54.5222133,22.0546989 C57.8359218,22.0546989 60.5222133,24.7409904 60.5222133,28.0546989 L60.5222133,49.0546989 C60.5222133,52.3684074 57.8359218,55.0546989 54.5222133,55.0546989 L47.0936419,55.0546989 C43.7799334,55.0546989 41.0936419,52.3684074 41.0936419,49.0546989 L41.0932133,43.8776989 L14.1205371,43.8777676 C11.4380112,43.8777676 9.26339425,41.7031506 9.26339425,39.0206247 C9.26339425,36.3380988 11.4380112,34.1634818 14.1205371,34.1634818 L41.0932133,34.1626989 L41.0936419,28.0546989 C41.0936419,24.7409904 43.7799334,22.0546989 47.0936419,22.0546989 L54.5222133,22.0546989 Z\" transform=\"rotate(-15 35.022 38.055)\"/></g></svg>\n",
        "selection": {
